&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE OpenQueryByGrp DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE OpenQueryByGrp :
OPEN QUERY {&QueryName} FOR EACH {&TableName} NO-LOCK
    WHERE {&TableName}.cod_grp_usuar >= v-grp-grupo-ini
      AND {&TableName}.cod_grp_usuar <= v-grp-grupo-fim.

    RETURN "OK":U.

END PROCEDURE.

/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
&ANALYZE-RESUME

